          "text": "kud irum piny i bang’gi, kadi kud itim igi; kum an a Yehova ma Mungu peri a Mungu ma janyeko, m’aketho dubo mi wego wi nyithindho, wi dhanum’utuk mir adege ku mir ang’wende mi ju m’udaga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.5"
            ]
