          "text": "kum Yehova timo polo ku ng’om i ceng’ abusiel, ku nam, ku giki ceke ma ni i ie, man eyom i ceng’ mir abirone: kum kumeno Yehova mio mugisa kum ceng’ sabatu, man edwoke leng’.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
