            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.12.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man dhanu ceke neno morpolo, ku lukoth, ku dwand agwara, man got m’uthwugo yiro: e ka dhanu neno maeni, kumgi miel, man gicungo ku bor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man giwacu ni Musa kumae, Wec i bang’wa in, e wabiwinjo; ento Mungu kud uwec i bang’wa, wamaru tho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Musa wacu ni dhanu kumae, Lworo kud unegwu: kum Mungu bino mulo iwu, man kara lworo pare bed i weng’wu, kara kud wudubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E dhanune gicungo ku bor, man Musa eoro ceng’ni ba mudho ma bii ka ma Mungu ni i ie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
